118
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:50,380
External events also cause market imbalances.

119
00:07:51,180 --> 00:07:56,980
External events can be things such as a bomb going off somewhere or a plane being shot down.

120
00:07:57,580 --> 00:08:05,780
Unfortunately, most external events are sort of on the negative side, but the market does have knee-jerk reactions to it.

121
00:08:07,580 --> 00:08:11,380
And oftentimes you'll see big moves really quick.

122
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:14,380
People basically sweeping everything in the book.

123
00:08:15,180 --> 00:08:16,580
That's causing imbalances.

124
00:08:17,780 --> 00:08:19,480
Stops also cause imbalances.

125
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:21,940
When you get to a level and a

126
