189
00:11:57,396 --> 00:12:01,396
So keep in mind, markets trend around 20% of the time.

190
00:12:01,496 --> 00:12:05,796
That means 80% of the time, the market is doing what it's supposed to do.

191
00:12:05,896 --> 00:12:07,196
